    NYX @ talk "Encontre-os e elimine-os."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:68
translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_GoToCaptainNyxOffice_c2211533:

    # NYX @ angry "I'll string up a few of the bodies when you're done, then they'll know not to fuck around."
    NYX @ angry "Vou pendurar alguns dos corpos quando terminar, aí eles saberão que não devem se meter."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:72
translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_f1792b2d:

    # NYX @ angry "Because we're stretched thin enough as it is, Alcott keeps pulling my men into whatever division he thinks is most important for the day and he's leaving me severely short-handed."
    NYX @ angry "Porque já estamos com pouca gente como está, Alcott fica tirando meus homens para a divisão que ele acha mais importante no dia e está me deixando com falta grave de pessoal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:73
translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_a52b06f6:

    # NYX @ angry "The fucker's so busy worrying about the enemy beyond the wall, he forgets about the threats from within."
    NYX @ angry "O desgraçado fica tão preocupado com o inimigo além do muro que se esquece das ameaças de dentro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:74
translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_7d5932ee:

    # MC @ talk "I take it you don't approve of his leadership?"
    MC @ talk "Parece que você não aprova a liderança dele?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:75
translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_3443fedc:

    # NYX @ talk "Better than Mesamor, but even the best fruit is doomed to fall if the tree's rotten."
    NYX @ talk "Melhor que Mesamor, mas até a melhor fruta está condenada a cair se a árvore estiver podre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:76
translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_97dfcab2:

