    # NYX @ talk "We can discuss politics all you want when you're done."
    NYX @ talk "Podemos discutir política o quanto você quiser quando terminar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:82
translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_5e99b9b0:

