translate ptPT qst_DarkKnight_1_atCaptainNyxOffice_menu_8961b27f:

    # NYX @ angry "Do you really think if things weren't that bad, Lukkan would be calling upon someone from the fucking Adventurers Guild of all things to help me out?"
    NYX @ angry "Você realmente acha que se as coisas não estivessem tão ruins, Lukkan estaria chamando alguém logo da porra da Guilda dos Aventureiros para me ajudar?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheDarkKnight/scr_1.rpy:102
